   "6a4fb62e71ef136200519ea1": {
    "id": "6a4fb62e71ef136200519ea1",
    "key": "2027-04-17T14:00:00",
    "seriesId": "6a4ea403759e922f00d70af9",
    "definition": {
     "start": "2027-04-17T14:00",
     "end": "2027-04-17T16:00",
     "title": "Open Art Lab",
     "description": "<p>Unleash your inner maker at our Open Art Lab! This is your dedicated space and time to bring your creative projects to life. Whether you're a seasoned pro or just getting started, you'll have access to professional tools like:</p>\n<ul><li>Sewing & Serger Machines</li><li>Cricut Maker & Supplies</li><li>And much more!</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Supplies Provided & Needed</strong></p>\n<ul><li><strong><em>We Supply</em></strong><strong>:</strong> Sewing machines, basic tools, black/white thread, and standard needles, mats, button maker, etc</li><li><strong><em>For Your Project, Please Bring</em>:</strong> Your fabric,&nbsp;specialty thread/notions, cardstock, vinyl, etc.</li></ul>\n<p>Work on your own projects, get inspired by fellow creators, and get a little help if you get stuck. No more excuses—your next masterpiece is waiting!</p>\n<p><em><strong>Important Note:</strong></em> To ensure everyone gets a turn, we have a sign-up system for our popular machines (Sewing, Serger, Cricut). <strong>Please sign up in-person upon arrival for 30-minute sessions.</strong><em><br><br><br>Funded by Friends of the Oakland Public Library.</em></p>",
