     "title": "Toddler Storytime",
     "description": "<p><strong>Songs, active rhymes and stories especially for ages 18 months to 3 years</strong>.</p>\n<p> Every Tuesday morning at 10:15am.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Stay and play after Storytime with fun age-appropriate toys through 11:15am.&nbsp;If conditions allow, Storytime will be held outside the library building.<br></p>\n<p><em>We ask that patrons refrain from wearing scented products.</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://oaklandlibrary.org/faqs/how-can-i-request-event-accommodations/?_gl=1*gb51bo*_ga*MTk0MzA3NzQ4MS4xNzEwMDI1MzY4*_ga_G99DMMNG39*MTcxMDAyNzQ3MS4yLjAuMTcxMDAyNzQ3MS4wLjAuMA..*_ga_L60VDC2VGD*MTcxMDAyNTM2Ny4xLjEuMTcxMDAyNzQ3MS4wLjAuMA..\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Get accessibility information</a>.<br></p>",
